cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset or code, please cite it as below."
title: "APEX-05: Arabidopsis spaceflight transcriptomics, root architecture, and ML-based sample quality control"
abstract: >-
  FAIR data and analysis package for the Advanced Plant Experiment-05 (APEX-05)
  spaceflight study of Arabidopsis thaliana. Compares wild-type Col-0 with
  reactive-oxygen (rbohD) and calcium-transport (cax22, cax23) signalling mutants
  under spaceflight versus ground control, profiling shoot and root
  transcriptomes (RNA-seq) and root system architecture (RSML). Includes a
  reproducible machine-learning quality-control pipeline that recovers tissue
  identity from expression and documents the resolution of a cax23 sample-
  labelling anomaly.
type: dataset
